# Pull requests

Before creating or updating a pull request:

1. Run `dart format lib test` and `flutter analyze`. Fix failures; do not leave format drift.
2. Run `flutter test` (or focused tests) when logic changed.
3. Update `CHANGELOG.md` under `## [Unreleased]` for user-facing or notable changes (Added / Changed / Fixed / Removed). Skip pure internal refactors with no user or ops impact.
4. Only then push and open/update the PR.
